We need to find template ID. Use search_template_catalog_by_criteria with bonds formed: Diels-Alder forms two C-C sigma bonds (6-6?). In forward reaction, bonds formed between diene and dienophile: two new sigma bonds connecting 1-6 and 4-5 positions. Could specify bonds_formed as "C-C". Not sure.

Maybe easier: use search_template_catalog_by_criteria with functional_groups_formed: maybe "ester". But we need Diels-Alder template. Let's try search without criteria to get list.

{
    "tool_name": "search_template_catalog_by_criteria",
    "arguments": {
        "molecule_smiles": "COC([C@]12CC=CC[C@H]1C(C2)=O)=O",
        "limit": 20
    }
}
